# The native shells ARE source: the microphone permission, the usage-description
# string, icons and signing config all live in them, and a shell that is
# regenerated loses every one of those edits. Capacitor ships its own .gitignore
# inside android/ and ios/ that excludes build output, Pods and copied web
# assets, so committing the platforms costs us nothing generated.
android/app/src/main/assets/
ios/App/App/public/
